---
// The mark the first screen opens on, in place of a photograph: "SA", the
// initials in Latin letters on both languages' pages, in the accent inside a
// raised circle. It is hidden from assistive technology, because the name is
// the next thing on the page and says the same thing in full.
---

<div
  aria-hidden="true"
  data-monogram
  lang="en"
  dir="ltr"
  class="grid size-14 place-items-center rounded-full border border-border bg-card text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary shadow-(--shadow-raised) select-none"
>
  SA
</div>
